#: ../../source/base/echo_pyramid.rst:44
msgid ""
"The ``AtomicEchoPyramidBase`` class controls the Echo Pyramid base for "
"Atom Series, providing audio playback/recording, touch input, and dual "
"RGB LED strips."
msgstr ""
"``AtomicEchoPyramidBase`` 类用于控制 Atom 系列的 Echo Pyramid "
"底座，提供音频播放/录音、触摸输入及双路 RGB 灯带。"

#: ../../source/base/echo_pyramid.rst:48
msgid ""
"Power must be supplied to both the EchoPyramid base and the Atom "
"controller."
msgstr "Echo Pyramid 底座与 Atom 控制器均需单独供电。"

